cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "ROS1 vs ROS2 Mapping Comparison"
abstract: >-
  Experiment pipeline, metrics and analysis tools for a practical, system-level
  comparison of ROS1 and ROS2 mapping pipelines (slam_toolbox, GMapping) on a real
  mobile robot, including ROS2 middleware (Fast DDS, Cyclone DDS, Zenoh) and
  distribution (Humble, Jazzy) comparisons.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Temova
    given-names: Anastasija
repository-code: "https://github.com/ATemova/ros1-ros2-mapping-comparison"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ROS
  - ROS 2
  - SLAM
  - slam_toolbox
  - middleware
  - DDS
  - Zenoh
  - benchmarking
